
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Client Application
    participant Python as Python Script (Orchestrator)
    participant LC as LangChain/Bedrock Client
    participant LLM as Claude 3.5 Sonnet (Parser)

    App->>Python: 1. analyze_snowflake_ddl(DDL_Script)
    activate Python

    Python->>Python: 2. Initialize LLM (get_bedrock_llm)
    Python->>Python: 3. Infer Alias Mapping (e.g., sd -> dc_table)

    Note over Python,LLM: Structured Output Configuration (Pydantic Schema enforced)

    Python->>LC: 4. Chain.invoke(DDL, Pydantic Schema, System Prompt)
    activate LC

    LC->>LLM: 5. Send API Request (SQL DDL + Tool Definition)
    activate LLM
    LLM-->>LLM: 6. Analyze SQL: Extract Columns, Joins, Transformations
    LLM-->>LLM: 7. Generate JSON conforming to SnowflakeViewDetails schema
    LLM->>LC: 8. Return Structured JSON Response
    deactivate LLM

    LC->>LC: 9. Validate JSON against Pydantic model
    LC->>Python: 10. Return validated Pydantic Object
    deactivate LC

    Python->>Python: 11. Post-process (e.g., resolve full source tables)
    Python->>Python: 12. save_to_csv(result)
    Python->>App: 13. Return SnowflakeViewDetails Object
    deactivate Python
